OL,3,ARoger's colleagues step up after injury
OL,4,Aends BBC presenter's running challenge
OL,5,
OL,6,FI'm not much of a runner. I never have
OL,7,Fbeen.
OL,9,FBut I have been getting my trainers on
OL,10,Fmost mornings for the past 18 months,
OL,11,Fsimply to stay fit and lose weight.
OL,13,FSo, I wasn't too daunted when I was
OL,14,Fchallenged to run 26.2 miles (41km)
OL,15,Fover the space of two weeks for this
OL,16,Fyear's BBC Children in Need appeal.
OL,18,FLots of people do a marathon in one go,
OL,19,Fso how hard could it be?
